# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
#
# What web.Dockerfile may see: the workspace manifests, the shared TypeScript
# settings, the console and portal with the packages they build from, and the
# web server. Of each module, only its contracts and screens: the boundary
# lint (ADR 0016) keeps those from reaching module server code, which stays
# out. Everything else, including .env files and node_modules, stays out.

*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/*/package.json
!packages/*/package.json
!modules/*/package.json
!apps/console/
!apps/portal/
!packages/domain/src/
!packages/ui/src/
!modules/*/src/contracts/
!modules/*/src/console/
!modules/*/src/portal/
!scripts/web-server.ts
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/e2e
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
# Never secrets, wherever they sit.
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
